@startuml invariant-enforcement
!include ../../sellStocks/diagrams/sell-style.puml
title Make the accounting identity explicit
caption Proposed fee exercise — values in USD
rectangle "Gross proceeds\n1100.00" as G
rectangle "Fee\n1.10" as F
rectangle "Net proceeds\n1098.90" as N #E4F3EF
rectangle "Cost basis\n1000.00" as C
rectangle "Profit\n98.90" as P #E4F3EF
G -down-> N : subtract fee
F -left-> N
N -down-> P : subtract cost basis
C -left-> P
note bottom of P
 1000.00 + 98.90 + 1.10 = 1100.00
 A shared formula helps only if
 every construction path respects it.
end note
@enduml
